ed and emphasised, visi Nizami Ganjavi Square, visit Javad Khan Tomb. Ganja owes its current tranquillity to the raging battles and courageous fighters of the past. The memory of Javad Khan, who died defending his beloved Ganja in one of these struggles, lives on in Javad Khan Mausoleum – a fitting tribute erected over his grave.', 113.0, 119.0, 137.0, 148.0, 325.0, 442.0, 709.0, 677.0, 677.0, 30.0, 65.0);
