imbing up the \n   endless stone stairs.) \n    \n   -Flame Towers (The city''s tallest building. The height of 182 m.  \n   Flame Towers - consisting of three high-rise buildings in the complex.)', 41.0, 47.0, 47.0, 59.0, 118.0, 147.0, 177.0, 206.0, 206.0, 12.0, 47.0);
